Error [jet.TypestateWrongState]: `pay` needs `Reservation.Pending`, but `r` is `Reservation.CheckedIn`
  --> first.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     r = r.pay()
    |           ^^^
 Why: Typestate: `pay` takes only `Reservation.Pending`; calling it with `Reservation` in another state is the out-of-order bug the state list rules out
 Fix: Bring `r` to `Reservation.Pending` before calling `pay`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150

